<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (The Swachhata Hi Seva Abhiyan 4.0 pledge was administered in Hindi and English at AVNL Corporate Office. The pledge event was led by Shri C. Ramachandran, Director/Finance. Shri B. Pattanaik, Director/HR, Shri  Harekrishna Behera, Chief General Manager and Shri Praveen Kumar, CGM along with other Group A officials had taken pledge. This initiative underlines the commitment of all members of the organization towards cleanliness and hygiene in and around the premises. As part of Swachhata Hi Seva Abhiyan 4.0 and Ek Ped Maa Ke Naam, an area within the AVNL Corporate Office premises has been transformed into a lush green garden with native Indian trees. A plant nursery is set to be set up at this reclaimed space, which will enhance the aesthetic appeal of the environment and provide a shady, cool area for future use.)
