330 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (AVNL congratulates the well-deserved winners of the Inter-DPSU Sports Meet for the year 2024 held recently at Avadi, Chennai. The victory is a testimony to the exceptional talent and skill of the DPSU personnel. It was inspiring to see the determination and sportsmanship of the participants during the competitions, which promoted the spirit of camaraderie and brotherhood within the DPSUs. The sports meet had participants from Defence PSUs such as YIL \(Yantra India Limited\), AVNL \(Armoured Vehicles Nigam Limited\), BEML \(Bharat Earth Movers Limited\), TCL \(Troop Comforts Limited\) and MIL \(Munitions India Limited\). YIL emerged victorious. During the Closing Ceremony Shri Sanjay Dwivedi, CMD, AVNL and Shri C Ramachandran, Director/Finance, AVNL and Shri V R Rambhad, Chief General Manager, Heavy Vehicles Factory have encouraged and honoured the winners and the participants of the sports meet with awards and prizes.)
/Pg 24 0 R
/K [1]
>>
